@@ -17,6 +17,7 @@ All notable changes users can see. Format: [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachang
 ### Changed
 - `shop list` sorts products by price (cheapest first) by default; use `--sort name` to sort by name.
 - Prices over €1,000 now show with thousands separators (e.g. €1,249.00).
+- `shop report` now displays dates in ISO format (YYYY-MM-DD) instead of European format (DD/MM/YYYY) to prevent confusion with US date interpretation.
 
 ### Fixed
 - `shop show` and `shop list` now display "Out of stock" instead of "0 left" when a product's stock is zero.
